%SIXMD 1
# @?MOUNT.TSFS - MOUNT A TSFS DEC@TAPE SET READ ONLY

## @?OPTIONS

## @?OPERANDS

### @?SOURCE FILE
DEC@TAPE SEED DEVICE /DEVICE/DTC0 THROUGH /DEVICE/DTC7.

### @?TARGET DIR
EXISTING DIRECTORY ON WHICH THE TSFS SET IS MOUNTED.

## DESCRIPTION

MOUNT.TSFS SCANS THE TSFS MEMBER SET BEGINNING WITH THE SELECTED DEC@TAPE
UNIT, BUILDS THE KERNEL MOUNT HANDOFF, AND MOUNTS THE COMPLETE SET READ ONLY.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - MOUNT SUCCEEDED
### @?1 - BAD OPERANDS, INCOMPLETE SET, OR MOUNT FAILED

